; A simple digital I/O module with a fixed PDO mapping, as many real devices
; have: the mapping objects (0x1600, 0x1A00, 0x1A01) and the PDO COB-IDs and
; transmission types are read-only, so a master can use the PDOs only as
; they are. Inputs 0x6000:1-3 (UNSIGNED8), outputs 0x6200:1-2 (UNSIGNED8).
; RPDO 1 carries 0x6200:1 and :2; TPDO 1 carries 0x6000:1 and :2; TPDO 2
; carries 0x6000:1 on a non-default COB-ID ($NODEID+0x380). 0x6000:3 is
; mappable but in no default mapping. Fixture for add-device-pdo-mapping.

